{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Notre part sauvage, la controverse du loup","Des Alpes au Grand Est, le retour du loup suscite nombre de réactions. À l'heure où la place du sauvage doit être réévaluée, philosophes, anthropologues, environnementalistes et bergers, nous aident à discerner les enjeux de notre relation au monde agricole, nos habitudes de consommation et notre rapport à l'altérité.",[4,5],"natural","self-employment",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":26,"media":28,"synopsis":31,"production":32,"characters":35,"roles":36,"awards":41,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_242","fr2023-242-notre-part-sauvage-la-controverse-du-loup",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2023-01-01",2023,"Documentary",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Jean-Pierre Valentin","jean-pierre-valentin",1963,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[27],"Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":29,"trailerUrl":30},"https://images-film-documentaire.fr/film/789/32542D20178E43E9AE60ADE1726DB789.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IzYPXuNmbs4",{"native":2,"english":11},[33],{"country":24,"share":34},"Majority coproducer",[],[37],{"person":38,"role":40},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":39},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
